    "This test writes about %@ to the drive. Larger sizes reveal SLC-cache and thermal slowdowns but add more wear.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次测速将向硬盘写入约 %@。数据量越大,越能暴露 SLC 缓存耗尽和过热降速,但也会增加写入磨损。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a drive and size, then Run test.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择硬盘和测试大小,然后点击开始测速。"
          }
