            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该硬盘剩余空间不足以进行所选大小的测速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Benchmark read/write with a temperature overlay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测读写速度,叠加温度曲线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Link ceiling ~%lld MB/s · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链路理论上限 ~%lld MB/s · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theoretical link maximum (dashed line). Real speed is lower — the interface, enclosure, cable, and drive itself all limit it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "理论链路上限(虚线)。实际速度更低——接口、硬盘盒、缆线和硬盘本身都会限制速度。"
